// Tier 1 (correctness, security; error) and Tier 2 (modernization, performance; warn) Oxlint rules.
// Generated by build/compile.py from sources/typescript/oxlint-rules.md, for Oxlint >= 1.89.0.
// Use it when the project has no Oxlint configuration:  oxlint -c <this file> <paths>
